7 &#8212; SHAREHOLDERS&#8217; EQUITY (DEFICIT) </b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

