As of May 31, 2026, the Company had working capital of $415,637.</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our
